<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>DIVERGENCE — {{ company }} — Research Note</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 13mm 14mm 12mm 14mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9.3pt; line-height: 1.4; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0; }
  h1 { font-size: 17pt; margin: 0; color: #0d2440; }
  h2 { font-size: 11pt; margin: 11pt 0 3.5pt 0; color: #0d2440; border-bottom: 1.2pt solid #0d2440; padding-bottom: 1.5pt; }
  h2 .n { color: #b07d10; }
  p { margin: 0 0 4pt 0; text-align: justify; }
  ul { margin: 0 0 4pt 0; padding-left: 13pt; }
  li { margin-bottom: 2pt; text-align: justify; }
  b, strong { color: #0d2440; }
  a { color: #0d4f8b; text-decoration: none; word-break: break-all; }
  .head { border-bottom: 2.8pt solid #0d2440; padding-bottom: 5pt; }
  .kicker { font-size: 7.8pt; letter-spacing: 1.6px; color: #7a5b00; font-weight: bold; }
  .sub { font-size: 9.3pt; color: #444; margin-top: 2pt; }
  .meta { float: right; text-align: right; font-size: 8.6pt; color: #333; line-height: 1.5; }
  .discovery { background: #0d2440; color: #fff; padding: 7pt 9pt; margin: 7pt 0 3pt 0; font-size: 10.6pt; line-height: 1.45; }
  .discovery b { color: #f0c040; }
  .strengthline { font-size: 8.8pt; color: #333; margin: 2pt 0 0 0; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.5pt 5pt; border-radius: 2pt; font-size: 8.4pt; font-weight: bold; color: #fff; vertical-align: middle; }
  .bs { background: #1e7d32; } .bm { background: #b07d10; } .bw { background: #9e2b25; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 3pt 0 5pt 0; font-size: 8.8pt; }
  th { background: #0d2440; color: #fff; text-align: right; padding: 2.4pt 5pt; }
  th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  td { border-bottom: .5pt solid #c9d2dd; padding: 2pt 5pt; text-align: right; }
  td:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f5f7fa; }
  .flag { color: #9e2b25; font-weight: bold; }
  .box { border: .9pt solid #0d2440; background: #fbfcfe; padding: 5pt 8pt; margin: 3pt 0 5pt 0; }
  .fals { border-color: #9e2b25; background: #fdf7f7; }
  .ev { font-size: 8.9pt; }
  .ev li { margin-bottom: 3.5pt; }
  .cls { display: inline-block; background: #e8eef5; border: .6pt solid #0d2440; border-radius: 2pt; padding: 0 3.5pt; font-size: 7.4pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0d2440; }
  .src { color: #555; font-size: 8.2pt; }
  img.chart { width: 100%; margin: 2pt 0; }
  .small { font-size: 8.4pt; color: #444; }
  .foot { border-top: .8pt solid #0d2440; margin-top: 8pt; padding-top: 3pt; font-size: 8pt; color: #555; text-align: justify; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="head">
  <div class="meta"><b>Run:</b> {{ run_stamp }}<br><b>Track:</b> {{ track }}<br><b>Participant:</b> Mrityunjay Mishra</div>
  <div class="kicker">DIVERGENCE — AUTONOMOUS FINANCIAL RESEARCH AGENT · MVP RUN</div>
  <h1>{{ company }}</h1>
  <div class="sub">NSE: {{ scrip }} · Yahoo: {{ ticker }} · Panel: {{ window }} · Finding the Next Signal — ATMOS 2026</div>
</div>

<div class="discovery"><b>THE DISCOVERY —</b> {{ discovery }}</div>
<p class="strengthline"><b>Evidence strength:</b> <span class="badge {{ strength_class }}">{{ strength | upper }}</span> — {{ strength_reason }}</p>

<h2><span class="n">1</span>&nbsp; WHY IT MATTERS</h2>
<ul>
{% for w in why %}<li>{{ w }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2><span class="n">2</span>&nbsp; NUMBERS — {{ pair_title }}</h2>
<img class="chart" src="{{ chart }}">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Quarter</th><th>Gross NPA %</th><th>Net NPA %</th><th>Implied PCR %</th><th>NII (Rs cr)</th><th>Net profit (Rs cr)</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
{% for r in num_rows %}  <tr><td>{{ r.q }}{% if r.one_off %} <span class="flag">†</span>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ r.gnpa }}</td><td>{{ r.nnpa }}</td><td>{{ r.pcr }}</td><td>{{ r.nii }}</td><td>{{ r.pat }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<p class="small">Implied provision coverage (PCR) = (GNPA − NNPA) / GNPA, computed by the engine from the reported ratio pair; it approximates the disclosed PCR (technical write-offs are excluded from disclosed PCR, so small gaps are expected). Persistence of the winning divergence: <b>{{ persistence }} quarters</b>; engine score <b>{{ score }}</b> (persistence × |drift| / σ). {{ band_note }}
{% if one_off_quarters %} <span class="flag">†</span> One-off-flagged quarters (expense/other-income outliers, excluded as persistence evidence for flow-based pairs): {{ one_off_quarters | join(", ") }}.{% endif %}</p>
{% if runners_up %}
<p class="small"><b>Also flagged by the scan (not headlined):</b>
{% for r in runners_up %}{{ r.title }} — persistence {{ r.persistence }} qtrs, score {{ r.score }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if funding %}
<p class="small"><b>Funding-mix context (annual, Screener balance sheet):</b>
{% for f in funding %}{{ f.year }}: borrowings were {{ f.ratio }}% of deposits{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %} — borrowings as a share of deposits across the most recent fiscal years; a falling share means growth is being funded by the deposit franchise rather than wholesale borrowing.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2><span class="n">3</span>&nbsp; TIMELINE — WHEN THE RELATIONSHIP BROKE</h2>
<table>
  <tbody>
{% for q, txt in timeline %}  <tr><td style="width:16%"><b>{{ q }}</b></td><td style="text-align:left">{{ txt }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2><span class="n">4</span>&nbsp; EVIDENCE — AUDITABLE TRAIL</h2>
<ul class="ev">
{% for e in evidence %}<li><span class="cls">{{ e.source_class }}</span> <b>{{ e.claim }}</b><br>
<span class="src">{{ e.source }} — <a href="{{ e.url }}">{{ e.url }}</a></span><br>{{ e.detail }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2><span class="n">5</span>&nbsp; COUNTERARGUMENT — THE STRONGEST CASE AGAINST</h2>
<div class="box"><p style="margin:0">{{ counterargument }}</p></div>

<h2><span class="n">6</span>&nbsp; FALSIFICATION CONDITION</h2>
<div class="box fals"><p style="margin:0">{{ falsification }}</p></div>

<div class="foot"><b>Method &amp; scope (MVP):</b> one pipeline run on one Track A company, produced end-to-end by the code in this repository — panel built from public Screener.in renders of the statutory results (standalone basis; the panel is the most recent 12 quarters, with one-off-contaminated quarters flagged mechanically), cross-checked against independent filing coverage; Yahoo Finance price history is fetched as market context only. The full system (filing-PDF parsing, peer panel, every Track A company) is the finals build described in the Round 1 report. All figures are reproducible from the committed panel CSV. This note is a research hypothesis with a stated falsification condition — <b>not investment advice</b>.</div>

</body>
</html>
